idea = Royal and Imperial Churches | Bishops and abbots hold lands and ride in the king's host. | church_power_modifier 0.10, technology_cost -0.10
idea = Hunting Lodges and Castles | Fortified halls of the lords are centres of local power. | fort_maintenance_modifier -0.15, garrison_size 0.20
