idea = Castles on the Marches | Frontier lords build earthwork and stone castles. | fort_maintenance_modifier -0.15, defensiveness 0.15
idea = The Roman Roads | Old roads connect the Frankish cities and keep trade alive. | trade_efficiency 0.10, movement_speed 0.05

